Node ID=30 the orders
Text=Men, mostly. <He sets the hammer down flat.> The Temple put twenty at the Gate and the Holy Office put its own at the Temple crossing, and both lines held until the golems came up the street, and then neither of them did. I shod horses for half those men. If your Order is sending more, tell them the street is too narrow for horses now.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will tell them.
