Node ID=40 no flinching
Text=<He looks at you properly for the first time, and keeps looking.> My friend, this morning I watched a thing made out of ice walk through the front of the Alvarez house with the family still in it. You are a man with a face. Come back tomorrow and I will be frightened of you again, if there is a tomorrow and I am in it.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Fair enough.
