Node ID=50 the reports
Text=<The hammer does not go down this time.> I have. A man who kills the ones who cannot hold anything heavier than a loaf. <He weighs it, and then he sets it aside anyway.> And this morning I have English in my street, so I will sell to you, and I will keep what I think between me and the anvil. Do not come back after the city is standing.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Your stock, then.
